  "/sb/11/10": [
    { title: "SB 11.10.1 \u2013 Distinction between pure & mixed bhakti \u2013 inside and outside Varanashrama boundaries!", href: "/sb/11/10/1" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.2 \u2013 Natural, easiest & guaranteed method to get out of ignorance!", href: "/sb/11/10/2" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.3 \u2013 Perception of objects of this world by materialist, monisit & vaishnavas !", href: "/sb/11/10/3" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.4 \u2013 2 types of pure devotees \u2013 fully renounced / follows varnashram without attachment !", href: "/sb/11/10/4" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.5-Different levels of Gurus & unique position of Acharya \u2013 Why & How to respect each of them!", href: "/sb/11/10/5" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.6 \u2013 Devotional qualities manifest by developing relationship with devotees & Lord FAVORABLY", href: "/sb/11/10/6" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.7 \u2013 Proper cultivation of Bhakti produces possessiveness to Krsna & natural detachment !", href: "/sb/11/10/7" },
    { title: "SB_11.10.8-True benefit for humanity \u2013 Educating their real identity & their relationship with Lord!", href: "/sb/11/10/8" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.9 \u2013 State of consciousness in material bodies, mukti, prema & the power of Nama sankirtan !", href: "/sb/11/10/9" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.10 \u2013 Ways to cut the bondage of body & soul \u2013 Maya\u2019s Vidya aspect / Transcendental Bhakti !", href: "/sb/11/10/10" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.11 \u2013 Key for spiritual progress \u2013 inquisitive to learn nature of atma & Lord with devotion!", href: "/sb/11/10/11" },
    { title: "SB_11.10.12 \u2013 Proper respect to Guru & following His instructions reveal transcendental Knowledge !", href: "/sb/11/10/12" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.13 \u2013 Process of Bhakti is eternal, beyond gunas, independent & superior to Karma, Jnana !", href: "/sb/11/10/13" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.14~16 \u2013 Acharya\u2019s compassionate service for the contrary statements in scriptures!", href: "/sb/11/10/14-16" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.17 \u2013 Eternal life \u2013 limitation in karma yoga & science and the strategy of Krsna Caitanya !", href: "/sb/11/10/17" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.18 \u2013 Real bliss for Jiva is attaining rasa, the Lord & highest bliss is in realizing Krsna!", href: "/sb/11/10/18" },
    { title: "SB_11.10.19 \u2013 Association \u2013 quick way to learn from experiences & Chanting \u2013 easy to realize Krsna !", href: "/sb/11/10/19" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.20-Sravanam assists chanting & Knowledge about Krsna manifests form,quality,pastimes in Name!", href: "/sb/11/10/20" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.21 \u2013 Real freedom \u2013 life limited by material nature and karma / life fulfills all wishes ?", href: "/sb/11/10/21" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.22~29 \u2013 \u201cWORSHIP ONLY KRISHNA\u201d \u2013 is not fanatical, it is practical !", href: "/sb/11/10/22-29" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.30 \u2013 Principle of Yukta vairagya in Bhakti & Bhakti is adaptable in all circumstances !", href: "/sb/11/10/30" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.31 \u2013 Bhakti is surprising, contrary, efficient in destroy karma, gives impossible results!", href: "/sb/11/10/31" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.32 \u2013 Realizing uselessness of material existence gives inspiration to realize atma & Lord !", href: "/sb/11/10/32" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.33 \u2013 How people face foretold death: Kamsa, Common Man & Pariksit!", href: "/sb/11/10/33" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.34 \u2013 Elements & functions of Lord\u2019s cit, acit shaktis & the better choice for Jivas !", href: "/sb/11/10/34" },
    { title: "SB- 11.10.35 \u2013 Jiva is always tatastha & it never fall down once manifestation of cit shakti is fixed!", href: "/sb/11/10/35" },
    { title: "SB 11.10.36~37-Symptoms of various types of conditioned & liberated souls to choose wise association!", href: "/sb/11/10/36-37" },
  ],
  "/sb/11/11": [
    { title: "SB 11.11.1 \u2013 Nature of Jiva as marginal, small & conscious never changes in bondage & liberated state !", href: "/sb/11/11/1" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.2 \u2013 Jiva\u2019s misconceptions about material world & the only way to get out of it !", href: "/sb/11/11/2" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.3 \u2013 Maya shakti\u2019s arrangement for bondage & liberation & cit shakti\u2019s influence in prema!", href: "/sb/11/11/3" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.4 \u2013 Jiva\u2019s real identity and goal based on its state in material and spiritual existence !", href: "/sb/11/11/4" },
    { title: "SB_11.11.5 \u2013 Fundamental principle in Vaidhi & Raganuga bhakti && astonishing bhakti process !", href: "/sb/11/11/5" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.6 \u2013 Jiva can give up eating the fruits by experiencing the highest fruit of all \u2013 Krsna !", href: "/sb/11/11/6" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.7 \u2013 Vaishnavas & Mayavadis vision about oneness & difference in Supreme Absolute Truth !", href: "/sb/11/11/7" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.8-Being humble & surrender to Guru \u2013 way to get confidential & most confidential knowledge!", href: "/sb/11/11/8" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.11 \u2013 Effort & result of karma (hard, bondage), jnana (trouble, liberation) & bhakti (easy, prema)!", href: "/sb/11/11/11" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.12~13 \u2013 Bhakti \u2013 the complete, easy & blissful process to realize atma & Supreme Lord !", href: "/sb/11/11/12-13" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.14 \u2013 Prema bhakta\u2019spranas, senses, mind, intelligence, gross body are saturated with prema!", href: "/sb/11/11/14" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.15 \u2013 Secondary result of Bhakti (destruction of suffering) is the primary goal of Jnana !", href: "/sb/11/11/15" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.16~17 \u2013 Follow the instructions of advanced devotees, do not imitate !", href: "/sb/11/11/16-17" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.18 \u2013 Karma, jnana, yoga \u2013 the useless endeavors which never give complete satisfaction for atma!", href: "/sb/11/11/18" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.19 \u2013 Srimad Bhagavatam \u2013 simplest presentation of the final truth & the parampara system !", href: "/sb/11/11/19" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.20 \u2013 All avatars are one with Krsna & Krsna, the full moon !", href: "/sb/11/11/20" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.21 \u2013 Without desire for knowledge, one cannot get knowledge & practice bhakti to fix on the Lord !", href: "/sb/11/11/21" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.22 \u2013 Pure bhakti cannot be equated with mixed bhakti & it is superior to sak\u0101ma & ni\u1e63k\u0101ma !", href: "/sb/11/11/22" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.23~24-Varnashrama duties coated with bhakti/bhakti mixed with material desire are not pure!", href: "/sb/11/11/23-24" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.25 \u2013 Pure devotee\u2019s association in any form purifies, best is to get knowledge of worship !", href: "/sb/11/11/25" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.26~27-Knowledge on specific spiritual goal & various process help to choose proper process!", href: "/sb/11/11/26-27" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.28 \u2013 Special quality of Svayam Bhagavan Krsna \u2013 Sweet relationship with His devotees !", href: "/sb/11/11/28" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.29~32-Vaishnava qualities are unlimited & constitutional to bhakti, surrender is primary!", href: "/sb/11/11/29-32" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.33 \u2013 Worship of one specific form develops greater prema than worshipping multiple forms!", href: "/sb/11/11/33" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.34~41 \u2013 Result of engaging senses in angas of bhakti with pure, mixed & without devotion!", href: "/sb/11/11/34-41" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.42 \u2013 All worship is meant for Supreme Lord, best is worship of Vaishnavas as Supreme Lord !", href: "/sb/11/11/42" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.43-45-Devotees prefer direct worship, still they respect all & aware of all pervading Lord!", href: "/sb/11/11/43-45" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.46 \u2013 Krsna is superior to Brahman & all Vishnus. His pastimes attracts all types of yogis !", href: "/sb/11/11/46" },
    { title: "SB_11.11.47 \u2013 Purify Varnashrama duties with proper mentality, remembrance of Lord & sadhu sevaya !", href: "/sb/11/11/47" },
    { title: "SB 11.11.48 \u2013 Rely on sadhu sanga to understand & practice Bhakti \u2013 the conclusion of all scriptures !", href: "/sb/11/11/48" },
  ],
